<title>FRANCE: Rouen Oct 1-16 grain exports at 331,871 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Oct 1-16 grain exports at 331,871 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 331,871 tonnes between October 1 and October 16, French port officials said.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 547,000 tonnes in the whole of October 1995.</p>
<p>The 331,871 tonne total included 291,727 tonnes of wheat and 40,144 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes)-</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		     18,100</p>
<p>    Algeria			   50,612</p>
<p>    Cuba				26,250</p>
<p>    Britain			    6,360</p>
<p>    Greece			    11,606</p>
<p>    Italy			     56,894</p>
<p>    Libya			     21,355</p>
<p>    Morocco			   67,300</p>
<p>    Poland			     2,950</p>
<p>    Tunisia			   30,300</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		    33,000</p>
<p>    Colombia			   7,144</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
